{"version":1,"content":"<p>據德國設備製造商SINGULUS TECHNOLOGIES當地時間11月10日發佈的公告，<strong>SpaceX已與該公司籤署供應合同，將採購一條用於生產異質結太陽能電池的交鑰匙產線。首條產線訂單金額超過6000萬歐元，計劃於2027年上半年交付，相關產品將用於SpaceX的Starmind AI衞星。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585906.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:45:17.929479+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.604328+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.604328+00:00","content_hash":"317de090244eacf0c20325f6d3772753cd41580bf3853be38bac4615603f98b6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}